    <section class="landing-section faq">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <dl class="faq-list">
        <dt>How does dual-duty skinning work?</dt>
        <dd><div class="prose"><p>A single CSS stylesheet targets both <code>.cm-editor</code> in the admin WYSIWYM workspace and <code>.traven-preview</code> on public frontend pages.</p></div></dd>
        <dt>Can I customize release timeline categories?</dt>
        <dd><div class="prose"><p>Yes, release entries support standard <code>New</code>, <code>Improved</code>, and <code>Fixed</code> tag chips with automated color indicators.</p></div></dd>
      </dl>
    </section>
